msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-formatter-run.md:16
msgid ""
"`nix fmt` (an alias for `nix formatter run`) calls the formatter specified "
"in the flake."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-formatter-run.md:18
msgid ""
"Flags can be forwarded to the formatter by using `--` followed by the flags."
