#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-formatter-run.md:22
msgid ""
"The environment variable `PRJ_ROOT` (according to [prj-spec](https://github."
"com/numtide/prj-spec)) will be set to the absolute path to the directory "
"containing the closest parent `flake.nix` relative to the current directory."
